d044" facs="#m-f870bedb-3cf4-42c5-9479-46b5bb8b307e" label="text-like">out of Paschal Time.</l><l xml:id="m-deae68f8-038b-4ec2-a55a-120c5775772c" facs="#m-09e61b68-a92b-40df-98f5-81de81308dc5" label="ambiguous">short</l><l xml:id="m-526803ee-8fe9-44ce-93eb-ae49351ac268" facs="#m-0fd17271-2307-445d-aa9e-a513b4bcf402" label="ambiguous">Resp.</l><l xml:id="m-72cdcb6d-ffc2-478e-b6fc-3cc0802bbb36" facs="#m-5c001a2b-6ddd-4ec0-a1dd-92053972166e" label="ambiguous">O</l><l xml:id="m-fcef7591-ec0b-4893-a9cf-6da0be9b3af6" facs="#m-dca31280-b9ac-4f11-a9e9-76de3322fa79" label="lyrics-like">mnis térra adóret te, "Et psál-lat tí-bi. V. Psál¬</l><l xml:id="m-4ddb2e1e-8ef1-4bc2-847e-4a267acde541" facs="#m-50d00d15-9f81-454f-8f61-725d4cce79df" label="lyrics-like">mum dícat nómi-ni tú-o Dómine. Gló-ri-a Pátri.</l><l xml:id="m-a44c6c16-a137-4d80-80ad-6bc392b5fa19" facs="#m-bff78553-285d-4196-bd35-ddb9c113bcbe" label="lyrics-like">V. Hoc sígnum Crúcis érit in caélo.</l><l xml:id="m-f12ef9d9-7adb-41d9-b4dd-d645217fa3d0" facs="#m-13c3d3de-29d1-47e2-8881-41dea8906d52" label="lyrics-like">R. Cum Dóminus ad judicándum vénerit.</l><l xml:id="m-0b849f7d-e192-4e2b-889c-24d95e459ced" facs="#m-e2cf4132-ea11-44e0-b9da-4c88f6d81ed9" label="text-like">AT SECOND VESPERS.</l><l xml:id="m-e34688c9-a967-4621-bfe8-ab1219e00e75" facs="#m-6089a448-efe0-41bb-b43d-49407c93c84d" label="lyrics-like">Psalms. 1. Dixit Dóminus. 7. c. p. 132. — 2. Confitébor. 3. a. p. 135. —</l><l xml:id="m-bde4b85a-bed4-4f3b-ac65-39e0f301af05" facs="#m-d54a47a7-dcef-47b9-9151-360e453cfdcd" label="lyrics-like">3. Beátus vir. I. f. p. 140. — 4. Laudâte púeri. 7. c. p. 151. — 5. Lau¬</l><l xml:id="m-299de120-8114-473f-8575-4b2a8b4678d6" facs="#m-14ca679b-bfa3-4be3-a211-48c2fca1a5eb" label="lyrics-like">dáte Dóminum. 8. c. p. 168.</l><l xml:id="m-57a9cdef-f87a-4f76-8305-7babb00ac44e" facs="#m-3e70bf90-2d36-4166-8efc-73754954bc41" label="ambiguous">1. Ant.g</l><l xml:id="m-7a05de40-6856-456d-a5fd-b9207d4f155c" facs="#m-876b2f09-7a58-431c-ad07-fe1f435d68a3" label="ambiguous">7.e</l><l xml:id="m-b9bc4134-ceea-4a49-8c19-d806d5cd754d" facs="#m-bc9518c9-3813-487e-8065-5ca3f8007ad0" label="ambiguous">O</l><l xml:id="m-1de4a8ed-754c-4140-b4cd-eedd6b580098" facs="#m-bbeaca4d-f09e-42ca-a19d-0f22e868f147" label="lyrics-like">mágnum * pi-etá-tis ópus! mors mórtu-a tunc</l><l xml:id="m-a3630d1e-a3bd-4694-b562-7ab7d028aa22" facs="#m-7823db9b-9ddd-4a09-a494-13504967d4df" label="lyrics-like">est, in lí-gno quando mórtu-a vi-ta fú- it. T. P. Alle¬</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
